<title>GERMANY: German bank merger cuts up to 7,000 jobs-sources.</title>
<headline>German bank merger cuts up to 7,000 jobs-sources.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed merger of Bayerische Vereinsbank AG and Bayerische Hypobank will mean job cuts of between 5,000 and 7,000 over the next five years, sources said.</p>
<p>Earlier, the two Bavarian banks announced a two-stage merger plan which will allow full merger proceedings to start from October.</p>
</text>
